      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is 闫清, wearing the same everyday dark T-shirt and gray trousers as the previous shot. Identity anchor: a small old scar just above the outer end of his left eyebrow. He stays at frame left beside the phone, watching the screen, first serious and attentive, then briefly surprised and slowly smiling; no lateral movement.\n<Subject 2> is 摊主, the same clean-shaven middle-aged man in a dark navy work shirt and dark brown apron. Identity anchor: an old knife scar in the web of his right hand. He remains behind the counter at frame right and holds the phone steadily in his right hand.\n<Subject 3> is the same generic matte-black smartphone from the reference, with the same screen image: a small truck carrying calm live pigs entering a plain receiving gate. The phone stays one physical object and remains between the two faces; do not turn the phone screen into a full-frame location cutaway.\n<Subject 4> is the same early-morning pork stall. Keep the visible tile wall, wooden door, red-lamp glow, sausage string, counter and the pork tray at the lower edge in the same places.\n<Picture 1> fixes the exact close framing, camera position, screen direction, lighting and shot scale. Keep this composition for the entire shot.\n\nsummary:\nA single uninterrupted close two-person shot. The butcher calmly explains the meat and presents proof on his phone. Yan Qing watches the phone, pauses in surprise, then slowly smiles. The phone screen remains visible beside Yan Qing's face, showing the truck entering the gate.\n\nretention_analysis:\nYan Qing remains frame left with the same face, hair, scar and clothes; the butcher remains frame right behind the counter; the smartphone remains the same size, in the butcher's hand, with its pig-truck footage on screen; the stall and pork tray remain fixed. No cut, no camera move, no character swap, no added props.\n\ndetailed_description:\nPhotorealistic live-action drama, matching the input frame and S02 video: natural skin texture, believable expressions, restrained market colors and the same warm red pendant lighting. No animation, cartoon, game render, advertisement styling or product glamour.\n\n[Shot 1] Static eye-level 85mm close two-person shot from the same side of the 180-degree axis. The phone is foreground-center, screen facing the camera; Yan Qing's face stays clearly visible to its left; the butcher's face and presenting hand stay visible to its right. The phone is close to Yan Qing but does not touch him. Keep the same crop; do not widen, zoom, pan, rack focus away from the two faces, or cut to a new scene.\n\nContinuity: same market stall, same dark door, pale square tiles, same red-lamp color, same sausage anchor on the right pier. Only the part of the lamp row already visible in Picture 1 should remain visible; do not widen to reveal more lamps. The same single pork cut and metal tray stay partially visible at the bottom edge; their shape and position do not change. The slaughterhouse appears only as tiny moving footage inside the phone screen.\n\nOne continuous action over 12.25 seconds:\n0.0-3.5s The butcher holds the already raised phone steady at frame center-right and speaks calmly. The screen clearly shows the truck with live pigs approaching and entering the receiving gate. Yan Qing's eyes stay fixed on the screen; his face is serious.\n3.5-6.5s The truck moves forward inside the phone's small screen and clears the gate. The phone body, hand, stall background and framing stay still; the pigs remain calm and clearly inside the truck.\n6.5-8.5s Yan Qing absorbs what he sees; his eyes open slightly and his mouth pauses, a restrained moment of surprise. The butcher remains sincere and matter-of-fact.\n8.5-10.5s Yan Qing's mouth corners begin to rise slowly into a small, genuine smile while he keeps looking at the phone.\n10.5-12.25s The smile settles and holds. The phone stays steady with the truck stopped just inside the gate. End on the two faces and the phone screen in the same frame, with no further movement.\n\n<Subject 1> (S1) says, <d>[Chinese] 老板，你这猪肉是早上现杀的吗？</d> <Subject 2> (S2) says, <d>[Chinese] 你放心，绝对新鲜，</d> <Subject 2> (S3) says, <d>[Chinese] 刚从屠宰场拉回来，不信你看看。</d> Off-screen voice-over (S4), <d>[Chinese] 嘿，是挺新鲜。</d>\n\nNo subtitles, captions, readable text, logos or UI overlays. No pig squeals or animal distress. No non-diegetic music.",
